  data: {
    LLM: 'Players receive secret roles and hands of path or action cards. On each turn a player plays a path card, plays an action card to help or hinder, or discards and draws. The round score depends on whether a valid path reaches the treasure.',
    Player: 'Players receive secret roles and hands of path or action cards. On each turn a player plays a path card, plays an action card to help or hinder, or discards and draws. The round score depends on whether a valid path reaches the treasure.',
    objective: 'Miners try to complete a path to the gold while saboteurs try to prevent the route before the deck runs out.',
    gameplay: 'Players receive secret roles and hands of path or action cards. On each turn a player plays a path card, plays an action card to help or hinder, or discards and draws. The round score depends on whether a valid path reaches the treasure.',
    keyRules: [
      'Roles are hidden as Miner or Saboteur.',
      'Path cards must connect legally to the existing tunnel network.',
      'Action cards can block, repair, or manipulate other players.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
